                                "sense_id": "812a3c0e-00bd-31fb-a595-b3c12be1be49",
                                "text": "Having spaced the beams of the upper deck according to the disposition of the beams below, the ladderways should be so contrived, that in ships of war there should be one next abaft the fore hatchway, which is a single ladderway[…]"
